tunidad única en ‌Elviria ‌con ‌espacio, ‌vistas ‌y calidad de vida. ‌Contáctanos ‌hoy ‌para ‌organizar ‌tu ‌visita ‌privada.","en":"This property stands as a luxury villa for sale in Elviria on a 4,012 m² south facing plot with panoramic Mediterranean sea views. The home offers 713 m² across three levels with four bedrooms, private ensuite bathrooms, a heated swimming pool, a garage, and extensive parking. It sits in a quiet green enclave just 15 minutes from Marbella and close to beaches, golf, restaurants, and international schools.\n\nInside, the villa combines classic Andalusian elegance with modern comfort. The bright living room features a central fireplace and large sliding glass doors to the terrace. A stylish dining area connects to a covered outdoor lounge with glass curtains and a built in BBQ. The kitchen is spacious and filled with natural light from arched windows.\n\nThe gardens feel like a private park with palm trees, walking paths, a traditional gazebo, and total privacy. The lower level adds flexible space for a gym, bar, or extra ‌bedroom ‌plus ‌a ‌traditional ‌wine ‌bodega. This ‌is a ‌rare Elviria villa with space, ‌views, ‌and ‌lifestyle ‌in ‌one secure setting. Contact ‌us ‌today ‌to ‌arrange ‌your ‌private ‌viewing."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Colegios","Sur","Excelente","Privada","Con Calefacción","Aire Acondicionado","Mar","Jardín","Piscina","Terraza Cubierta","Armarios Empotrados","Cerca de Transporte","Terraza Privada","Sauna","Lavadero","Suelo de Madera","Suelos de Mármol","Barbacoa","Doble acristalamiento","Sótano","Fibra óptica","Privado","Alarma","Más de uno","Privado","Paneles Solares Térmicas","Lujo"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Schools","South","Excellent","Private","Heated","Air Conditioning","Sea","Garden","Pool","Covered Terrace","Fitted Wardrobes","Near Transport","Private Terrace","Sauna","Utility Room","Wood Flooring","Marble Flooring",